{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1350041-superhero-conversions","id":1350041,"title":"Superhero Conversions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-21T10:15:35-08:00","id":1350041,"title":"Superhero Conversions","content":"In an effort to keep myself fresh with the System, indulge my inner geek, and create new Paths, I am working on a number of conversions of pre-existing heroes to Trinity Continuum. I will mostly be doing Novas, but may perhaps get around to some Talents. Many of these will have Custom Paths that I will, eventually, try and compile.<br /> <br /> To start will be characters from vastly different ends of the power spectrum while both being decidedly superhuman. <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Jessica Jones (Marvel Cinematic Universe)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Origin: Suburbia</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Role: Detective:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Society: Alias Investigations</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Skills: Athletics 1, Close Combat 1, Culture 1, Empathy 3 (Lie Detection), Enigmas 4 (ST:Connecting the Dots, Patterns), Integrity 1, Larceny 3 (Sleight of Hand), Persuasion 1, Technology 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes: Intellect 4, Might 2, Presence 3, Cunning 4, Dexterity 2, Manipulation 2, Resolve 3, Stamina 2, Composure 3 (Favored Approach: Might)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Edges: Patron 2 (Trish Walker), Photographic Memory 2, Wealth 1, Swift, Fame 1 (Nova Template)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quantum: 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Transcendence: 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Attributes: Mega-Might 2, Mega-Stamina 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Edges: Dense Flesh 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quantum Powers: Flight 1 (Restricted: Upwards only)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">XP Cost: 74</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Contacts: Trish Walker (Patron), Jeri Hogarth, Malcom Ducasse</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Superman (Clark Kent/Kal-El) (DC Extended Universe)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Origin: Farm Life</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Role: Paragon of Virtue</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Society: Daily Planet, Justice League</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Skills: Aim 1, Athletics 1, Close Combat 2, Command 1, Culture 1, Humanities 3, Integrity 4, Persuasion 3, Survival 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes: Intellect 2, Might 2, Presence 4, Cunning 1, Dexterity 2, Manipulation 2, Resolve 4, Stamina 4, Composure 4 (Favored Approach: Resistance)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Edges: Adrenaline Spike, Alternate Identity 2, Artistic Talent 1, Big Hearted, Danger Sense, Fame 2, Wealth 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quantum: 8</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Transcendence: 6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Transformations: Feeding Requirement (Solar Radiation), Inhuman Beauty, Vulnerability (Kryptonite Radiation)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Attributes: Mega-Might 8, Mega-Dexterity 4, Mega-Stamina 8, Mega-Presence 2, Mega-Composure 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Edges: Adaptation, Calming Composure, Durability 5 (Environmental), Dense Flesh 5, Immunity, Mega-Hearing, Mega-Scent, Mega-Vision, Mega-Speed, Spectrum Vision, Regeneration</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Quantum Powers: Flight 6, Quantum Attack 5 (Heat Vision - Range 2, Beam, Destructive), Quantum Attack 4 (Freeze Breath - Range 2, Entangle 2)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">XP Cost: 859</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Contacts: Lana Lang, Emil Hamilton, Lois Lane, Bruce Wayne/Batman</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":3331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","user":"tragedyjones","date":". 11-21-2019, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:41:26-08:00","id":1350050,"title":"","content":"When you're spending XP, are you buying path dots or skill and edge dots ala carte?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:43:23-08:00","id":1350051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1350041-superhero-conversions?p=1350050#post1350050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you're spending XP, are you buying path dots or skill and edge dots ala carte?</div> </div> </div> </div>Superman bought a dot in a second society path which I forgot to put in his total. Will correct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:46:59-08:00","id":1350053,"title":"","content":"But I mean are you buying second or third dots in paths they already have? It's more cost effective than buying skills and edges ala carte if they fall under a path. Also, you can improve or add contacts that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:48:12-08:00","id":1350056,"title":"","content":"No, if I wanted a more in depth sheet I probably should, but aside from new Paths I kept XP relegated to Nova traits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:49:50-08:00","id":1350058,"title":"","content":"Obviously it would require stacking him with less power at character creation, but if you wanted to lean into Clark\u2019s connection to humanity resisting Transcendence, I might suggest the rule interpretation that lets you take Conditions as character creation to generate Momentum in game and give him Feeding Requirement and Kryptonite Vulnerability that way rather than tying it to Transcendence.<br /> <br /> Obviously it\u2019s hard in Aberrant rules to balance his power level and humanity but that\u2019s because of conceptual differences between Aberrant and most DC continuities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T10:54:05-08:00","id":1350060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1350041-superhero-conversions?p=1350058#post1350058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obviously it would require stacking him with less power at character creation, but if you wanted to lean into Clark\u2019s connection to humanity resisting Transcendence, I might suggest the rule interpretation that lets you take Conditions as character creation to generate Momentum in game and give him Feeding Requirement and Kryptonite Vulnerability that way rather than tying it to Transcendence.<br /> <br /> Obviously it\u2019s hard in Aberrant rules to balance his power level and humanity but that\u2019s because of conceptual differences between Aberrant and most DC continuities.</div> </div> </div> </div>That could be neat as well. I mostly realized he was going to have a high Transcendence just from his huge Quantum score. So I found the best fits I could.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T12:57:55-08:00","id":1350089,"title":"","content":"Superman is great... 859 XP! I would try to keep him down and use lots of Stunts and Maxing Outs in the play, but you made it in a interesting way. Superman is not a noob or even a veteran, he is SUPERMAN (not the deepest hero, not the one with the best power set, but yet the most powerful In DC)<br /> <br /> Jessica Jones is exactly what I expected form a Dark Star.<br /> <br /> Great job in both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T13:46:17-08:00","id":1350109,"title":"","content":"Next up - The Wolverine<br /> <br /> I am sure that I could have trimmed some points on the powers, but also could have spent another 200 more XP on Skills and Edges. He has 6 dots in Paths as is!<br /> <br /> Wolverine (James Howlett / Logan)<br /> Origin: Life of Priviledge<br /> Role: Combat Specialist x3 <br /> Society: X-Men / S.H.I.E.L.D.<br /> Skills: Aim 4, Athletics 4, Close Combat 5, Command 1, Integrity 2, Larceny 2, Survival 4<br /> Attributes: Intellect , Might , Presence , Cunning , Dexterity , Manipulation , Resolve , Stamina , Composure (Favored Approach: )<br /> Edges: Skilled Liar, Fast Draw, Forceful Martial Arts (Claws) 3, Danger Sense, Hair-Trigger Reflexes, Armor Expert, Breath Control<br /> Quantum: 3<br /> Transcendence: 4<br /> Transformations: Psychological Shift (Berserk Anger) <br /> Mega-Attributes: Mega-Stamina 3, Mega-Cunning 2<br /> Mega-Edges: Dense Flesh 2, Durability 1, Mega-Hearing, Mega-Scent, Regeneration<br /> Quantum Powers: Quantum Attack 3 (Piercing x3)<br /> XP Cost: 262<br /> Contacts: Dog Logan (Origin), Ogun, Captain America, Silver Samurai, Charles Xavier, Nick Fury","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T14:34:00-08:00","id":1350128,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=tragedyjones;n1350109]Next up - The Wolverine<br /> <br /> <br /> Attributes: Intellect , Might , Presence , Cunning , Dexterity , Manipulation , Resolve , Stamina , Composure (Favored Approach: )<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You're missing his Attribute scores, and is it possible he has the Immunity Mega-Edge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T14:36:07-08:00","id":1350129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1350041-superhero-conversions#post1350041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes: Intellect 2, Might 2, Presence 4, Cunning 1, Dexterity 2, Manipulation 2, Resolve 4, Stamina 4, Composure 4 (Favored Approach: Resistance)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Attributes: Mega-Might 8, Mega-Dexterity 4, Mega-Stamina 8, Mega-Presence 2, Mega-Composure 2</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Intellect 2 for a major newspaper's star reporter? He also needs Might 5, Dexterity 4, and Stamina 5 in order to gain those Mega-Attributes. He'd need Might 3+ for being a muscular 6' tall farm boy anyway.<br /> <br /> For your Wolverine writeup, I'm nor sure how you can have Dog Logan or Ogun as contacts since you have to be able to reliably contact them for them to count as contacts. Dog Logan shows up every few years on his own terms (usually as an antagonist), and I'm pretty sure Ogun is currently a (mostly) dead antagonist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T08:27:02-08:00","id":1350239,"title":"","content":"It's been a minute since I watched Jessica Jones. Does she really Fly or just Quantum Leap?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T13:04:41-08:00","id":1350291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1350041-superhero-conversions?p=1350239#post1350239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's been a minute since I watched Jessica Jones. Does she really Fly or just Quantum Leap?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is fairly implied that she has the ability to fly, but no skill at such. There are a few times she moves vertically that seem much less jump and much more &quot;vaguely aimed flight&quot;.<br /> <br /> As for the other chars, I will fix them this weekend and hopefully do 1-2 more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T11:54:42-08:00","id":1357078,"title":"","content":"Yeah I took a month before doing another. Been busy!<br /> <br /> Ben Grimm, The Thing<br /> <br /> Origin: Street Rat<br /> <br /> Role: Combat Specialist/Pilot<br /> <br /> Society: Fantastic Four<br /> <br /> Skills: Aim 1, Athletics 2, Close Combat 4 (Unarmed, ST: Sucker Punch), Culture 1, Empathy 1, Integrity 3 (Fighting Through Pain), , Persuasion 1, Pilot 4 (Aerospace, Military Jets, Q-Tech Contraptions), Survival 1, Technology 1<br /> <br /> <br /> Edges: Eufiber 1, Fame 1, Forceful Martial Arts (Unarmed) 2, Hair Trigger Reflexes, Hardy 1, Tough Cookie<br /> <br /> Quantum: 4<br /> <br /> Transcendence: 6<br /> <br /> Transformations: Epidermal Shift (Rocky Hide), Psychological Shift (Bouts of Anger and Depression), Uncontrolled Dormancy (Random reversions)<br /> <br /> Mega-Attributes: Mega-Might 3, Mega-Stamina 2<br /> <br /> Mega-Edges: Durability 3 (Environmental 1, Soft 2)<br /> <br /> <br /> XP Cost: 148<br /> <br /> Contacts: Yancy Street Gang (Origin), Logan (Combat Expert), Carol Danvers (Pilot), Spider-Man (Fantastic Four)<br /> <br /> Armor 4 Soft, 0 Hard (Scale 3)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":3331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","user":"tragedyjones","date":". 12-26-2019, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}